================================================================================
WHAT THIS PROJECT DOES NOT CONTAIN
================================================================================

Sumika ships no advertising SDK, no analytics SDK, no crash-reporting SDK, and no
in-app purchase or subscription code. Telemetry is hard-disabled at the build
level (see gradle/build-logic/src/main/kotlin/mihon/gradle/BuildConfig.kt) and
cannot be re-enabled with a build flag.
